Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.27,0:01:04.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我不知道那一套词儿咋说\N{\fs45}I don't know the right words.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:08.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,本该有个修士在这儿的\N{\fs45}Ought to be a septon here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:16.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,您是一位真正的骑士\N{\fs45}You were a true knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:20.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,只在我该受罚时才打我\N{\fs45}You never beat me when I didn't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:22.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs45}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:25.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,女泉镇那回除外\N{\fs45}Except that time in Maidenpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那回真是旅馆小弟偷吃了寡妇的馅饼\N{\fs45}It was the inn boy ate the widow woman's pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:35.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不是我干的 我跟您解释过\N{\fs45}Not me. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你竟然……\N{\fs45}Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:45.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,现在也无所谓了\N{\fs45}Doesn't matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我该把剑留给您 可它……\N{\fs45}I'd leave your sword, but it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,只会在泥土里锈掉\N{\fs45}it would only rust in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:14.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我真希望您没死 爵士先生\N{\fs45}I wish you didn't die, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.77,0:02:22.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我会照顾好马儿们的\N{\fs45}I'll take good care of the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:40.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,要是把你们仨卖了 我能像个国王一样吃喝\N{\fs45}Eat like a king if I sold you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,吃上个一两年吧\N{\fs45}For a year or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:46.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,之后如何呢？\N{\fs45}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:54.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那条路走到头不当土匪就得做乞丐\N{\fs45}That road ends in outlawry or beggary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:05.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们可以去个大城市\N{\fs45}We could go to a city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,君临？兰尼斯港？\N{\fs45}King's Landing? Lannisport?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,可以加入那儿的守备队\N{\fs45}Could join the City Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,“停止奸淫 先生！”\N{\fs45}Stop raping, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.43,0:03:47.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,很称我的手 就像之前很称老人的手\N{\fs45}Fits my grip as well as it ever fit his.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.11,0:03:54.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,而且岑树滩草场正要举办一场比武会\N{\fs45}And there is a tourney at Ashford Meadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那边的 你是马童吗？\N{\fs45}Hello there. Are you the stableboy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我要你刷干净我骑的这匹马\N{\fs45}I want the palfrey rubbed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:39.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,还要喂它们三个吃燕麦 你会照料它们吗？\N{\fs45}And oats for all three. You tend to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:42.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,当然可以 假如我愿意的话\N{\fs45}I could, if I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:44.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,少来 照看好我的马\N{\fs45}None of that. See to the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.59,0:05:47.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,干得不错我就赏你一个铜板 不然就等着大耳刮子吧\N{\fs45}You'll get a copper if you do well, and a clout in the ear if not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.65,0:05:59.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,随便坐\N{\fs45}Sit where you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,咱家有上好的羔羊肉 香草烤的\N{\fs45}There's good lamb roasted with a crust of herbs
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,咱家小子还打下几只野鸭 你要吃啥？\N{\fs45}and some ducks my son shot down. Which will you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:19.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,都要\N{\fs45}Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你这个头可不该都要么\N{\fs45}You're big enough for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:36.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 从这儿去岑树滩有多远？ - 一天骑程\N{\fs45}-How much farther to Ashford? -Day's ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:41.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,咱家小子有没有帮你照料马啊 还是又溜了？\N{\fs45}Is my boy seeing to your horses or has he run off again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:44.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,没有 他在干活\N{\fs45}No, he's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.11,0:06:45.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,镇上一半人都跑去看比武大会了\N{\fs45}Half the town's gone down the tourney.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:47.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,咱要是松口 咱家小子也早去了\N{\fs45}Mine would, too, if I allowed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:49.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,说真的 咱也不知道他们为了啥\N{\fs45}I swear, I couldn't tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:51.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,骑士也都是肉长的\N{\fs45}Knights are built the same as other men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,咱还从没见过有哪次比武大会能让鸡蛋更好卖咧\N{\fs45}And I never knew a joust to change the price of eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:00.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你也要去比武?\N{\fs45}Bound for the tourney yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:02.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我梦见你了\N{\fs45}I dreamed of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:11.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你他妈离我远点 听见没？\N{\fs45}Stay the fuck away from me. You hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.31,0:07:14.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,大人？\N{\fs45}My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.21,0:07:39.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,甭理那酒疯子 爵士先生\N{\fs45}Never you mind that one, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:41.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,咱去看看肉好了没\N{\fs45}I'll see about your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.43,0:07:53.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,哈 吃我一招！\N{\fs45}Hiya! Take that! Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:57.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fs45}Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:07:59.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,大人\N{\fs45}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:02.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 你这个小贼！ - 我无意冒犯您\N{\fs45}-You thief! -I did not mean to offend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:05.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,把盔甲给我脱了 马上！\N{\fs45}Take that armor off you. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:08.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,雷霆没踢破你那颗榆木脑袋 你就谢天谢地吧\N{\fs45}And be glad Thunder didn't kick you in that fool head of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:10.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,它可是战马 不是小孩子骑的矮种马\N{\fs45}He's a war horse, not a boy's pony.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:12.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我能骑得跟你一样好\N{\fs45}I could ride him as well as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.99,0:08:14.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,闭上臭嘴吧\N{\fs45}Close your insolent mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:16.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我——\N{\fs45}I--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,给我听好了 我是个骑士\N{\fs45}I'm a knight, I'll have you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你看起来可不像骑士\N{\fs45}You don't look to be a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:23.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,怎么 难道所有骑士都一个样？\N{\fs45}What, all knights look the same, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fs45}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:26.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但他们都不像你这样\N{\fs45}But they don't look like you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:28.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你的剑带居然是绳子\N{\fs45}Your belt's made of rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:32.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,只要它能拴牢我的剑鞘 那就顶用\N{\fs45}So long as it holds my scabbard, it serves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:35.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,您是要去比武大会？您打算上场吗？\N{\fs45}Are you going to the tourney, then? Do you mean to enter the lists?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:38.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,应该是吧\N{\fs45}Yeah, I suppose I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.85,0:08:41.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,带上我一起吧 爵士先生 求您了\N{\fs45}Take me with you, ser. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:43.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你娘要是知道了会怎么说？\N{\fs45}And what might your mother say to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:44.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不会说什么\N{\fs45}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:45.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,她早死了\N{\fs45}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:47.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,老板娘不是你……\N{\fs45}Is the innkeeper not your...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:51.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你是个孤儿啊\N{\fs45}You're an orphan boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:53.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你是吗？\N{\fs45}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.53,0:08:57.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我曾是个孤儿\N{\fs45}I was. Once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.83,0:08:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,直到爵士带上我\N{\fs45}Till my ser took me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他教我使剑 骑马 还有……\N{\fs45}Taught me arms and riding, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,其实他教会了我一切\N{\fs45}and taught me everything, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.59,0:09:09.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,尽他所能\N{\fs45}Best he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.51,0:09:13.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,如果您能带我去岑树滩 我可以作你的侍从 爵士先生\N{\fs45}If you could bring me to Ashford, I could squire for you, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:15.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,到时候您也能尽您所能地教我\N{\fs45}And you can teach me best you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:18.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我不需要侍从 小家伙\N{\fs45}No, I have no need for a squire, lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:19.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,每个骑士都需要侍从\N{\fs45}Every knight needs a squire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:22.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,而且你看起来比别人更需要\N{\fs45}And you look like you need one more than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:27.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你看起来想挨一耳刮子\N{\fs45}And you look like you need a good clout in the ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:29.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,给我装袋燕麦\N{\fs45}Fill me a sack of oats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.03,0:09:32.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我这就去岑树滩 不带你\N{\fs45}I'm off for Ashford. Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.41,0:09:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,听着 小家伙 信我的……\N{\fs45}Look, lad, I promise you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你还是不要给我这样的人当侍从比较好\N{\fs45}you're better off not squiring for the likes of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:53.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这是谢你的\N{\fs45}For your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:57.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,随你怎么生闷气\N{\fs45}Sulk all you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:09:59.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我知道我一走 你就会赶忙把它捡起来\N{\fs45}I know you'll scoop it up as soon as I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:42.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fs45}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fs45}Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,打扰了 伙计\N{\fs45}Beg pardon, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:56.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我想跟比武大会的总管谈一谈\N{\fs45}I wish to speak to the master of the games.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:06.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fs45}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:08.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你有何贵干 伙计？\N{\fs45}What do you want, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.27,0:12:11.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,又打到你了！\N{\fs45}Got you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:14.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我是来参加比武大会的\N{\fs45}I came for the tourney.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:17.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我家大人的比武会是骑士们的竞赛\N{\fs45}My lord's tourney is a contest for knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:19.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你是骑士吗？\N{\fs45}You a knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:21.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,喂！\N{\fs45}Oi! Psst!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这位骑士 请教大名？\N{\fs45}A knight with a name, mayhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:29.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,邓克\N{\fs45}Dunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.17,0:12:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,邓克爵士\N{\fs45}Ser Dunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:37.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我从小就担任铜分树村的阿兰爵士的侍从\N{\fs45}I was squire to Ser Arlan of Pennytree since I was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:41.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他临死前亲手用自己的佩剑赐封我为骑士\N{\fs45}He knighted me before he passed, with his own sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:48.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,剑柄上镶着他的铜分\N{\fs45}That's his penny there in the hilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:52.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,没错 确实是把剑\N{\fs45}Well, a sword it is for a certainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不过我从没听说过所谓的铜分树村的阿兰\N{\fs45}But I've never heard of this Arlan of Pennytree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:57.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你说你是他侍从？\N{\fs45}You were his squire, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:59.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他一直要培养我当骑士\N{\fs45}He always meant for me to be a knight one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:02.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,像他一样\N{\fs45}as he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:04.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我会成为一名骑士吗 爵士先生？\N{\fs45}Am I to be a knight one day, ser?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.91,0:13:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,像您一样？\N{\fs45}As you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,弥留之际 他特地取来剑\N{\fs45}When he was dying, he called for his longsword
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,要我跪下\N{\fs45}and bade me kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:19.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,要我做一个好骑士\N{\fs45}Charged me to be a good knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.13,0:13:22.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,保护弱者和无辜之人\N{\fs45}To defend the weak and the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:27.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,全力卫国 我发誓谨遵教诲\N{\fs45}Serve the realm with all my might. And I swore that I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:35.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,话倒没错 任何骑士都能赐封骑士\N{\fs45}Any knight can make a knight, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:38.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你的赐封仪式有证人吗？\N{\fs45}Were there witnesses to your dubbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:40.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,只有荆棘树上的一只知更鸟\N{\fs45}Only a robin in a thorn tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:46.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这可是岑树滩镇 孩子\N{\fs45}This is Ashford town, lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:50.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你可知道在此地 假装许下了神圣誓言的人会有怎样的下场吗？\N{\fs45}Know what comes to men here who pzretend at sacred oaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 我没…… - 我们会把你扒光\N{\fs45}-I'm not-- -We hang you naked
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:55.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,绑住手脚吊起来\N{\fs45}by your hands and your feet...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,慢慢放低 尖木桩先戳进屁眼里\N{\fs45}lower you down asshole first onto a sharpened point
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:01.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,再插到你透心凉\N{\fs45}and fuck you dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:05.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们叫它“岑树滩尖凳” 现在我再问你一遍\N{\fs45}Call it the Ashford chair. So, I ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:08.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,除了一只破鸟之外 还有谁见证了你的赐封仪式吗？\N{\fs45}Were there witnesses to your dubbing besides a fuckin' songbird?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:13.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这个嘛…… 其实那天下着雨\N{\fs45}Well, the-- see, it was raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:17.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我逗你呢\N{\fs45}I'm bullshitting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:22.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,“岑树滩尖凳”\N{\fs45}"Ashford chair."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.03,0:14:25.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你脑子被驴踢了吗？\N{\fs45}You take a boot to the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:27.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这儿是河湾地 不是河间地\N{\fs45}This is the Reach, not the Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:29.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,-“岑树滩尖凳”- 你该不会觉得\N{\fs45}-"Ashford chair." -Think we're fending off
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:33.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们要防的 是那些到处流窜的村夫野老进入比武大会吧？\N{\fs45}some scourge of cottagers, scuttling about, entering tourneys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你需要钱\N{\fs45}You'd need coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,盔甲 坐骑 下人\N{\fs45}Armor. Horses. Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:42.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,训练 诸神慈悲\N{\fs45}Training, gods be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:46.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,想象一下 一穷二白的农夫在比武场上挑战莱昂诺·拜拉席恩\N{\fs45}Imagine the poor farmer charging down Lyonel Baratheon in the lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:48.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,呃 那将是……\N{\fs45}Mm, that would be--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:49.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,另一种乐趣所在\N{\fs45}A different sort of entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:52.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,呃 好吧 我不是什么农夫\N{\fs45}Mm. Well, I'm no farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.73,0:14:54.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,可你的穿着倒是挺像\N{\fs45}Yet you've come dressed as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:15:00.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是这样的 我家岑树滩伯爵\N{\fs45}Look, man, my Lord Ashford
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:03.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,自诩为大人物 七神才知道他怎么想的\N{\fs45}fancies himself of great import. Gods know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:05.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这就意味着 我要把所有的有产骑士\N{\fs45}Well, that means I'm to ward off every landed knight
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:07.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,和佣兵拦在门外\N{\fs45}and sellsword vying to challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:10.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你懂吗？王子们会来参赛的\N{\fs45}You understand? There are princes about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是 当然\N{\fs45}No, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你已故的主人\N{\fs45}Your late master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.63,0:15:27.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,到场的正牌骑士里有认得他的吗？\N{\fs45}He'll be known to the true knights here assembled?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.89,0:15:32.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,有一顶营帐 前面挂着唐德利恩家族的旗帜\N{\fs45}There was a pavilion flying the banner of House Dondarrion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:34.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,对 是他们家族的曼佛德爵士\N{\fs45}Aye, Ser Manfred of that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:37.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,阿兰爵士几年前曾在多恩为他父亲大人效劳\N{\fs45}Ser Arlan served his lord father in Dorne a few years past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:39.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,曼佛德爵士可能还认得我们\N{\fs45}Ser Manfred will remember us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.69,0:15:41.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,一闻便知 毫无疑问\N{\fs45}By scent alone, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:44.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,若他愿为你作保 你带他过来便是\N{\fs45}If he'll speak to your good honor, bring him here with you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:45.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,赶在明早比武大会开始前\N{\fs45}before the tourney begins on the morrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:47.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,随从就不必带了\N{\fs45}Leave your escorts behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:50.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 遵命 - 好\N{\fs45}-As you say. -Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你知道的吧 比武会上输了的话\N{\fs45}You are aware that those vanquished in tourney
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.83,0:15:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,武器 盔甲和坐骑都归赢家所有 必须支付赎金才能赎回\N{\fs45}forfeit their arms, armor, and horse to the victors, and must ransom them back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:01.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 那你准备好\N{\fs45}-Aye. -And you have coin
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 赎金没有？- 哦 天 没有\N{\fs45}-to pay such ransom? -Oh, gods, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:07.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我无须准备赎金\N{\fs45}I mean, I won't have need of coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:12.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fs45}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.85,0:16:14.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,妈的七层——\N{\fs45}Seven fu--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.41,0:16:37.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,帮我看好他们 好姑娘\N{\fs45}Mind those two. Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:45.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,打扰了 爵士们 我需要和曼佛德爵士谈谈\N{\fs45}Pardon, sers. I need speak with Ser Manfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.34,0:16:46.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fs45}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:49.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他睡觉呢 爵士 花一银鹿能叫醒他\N{\fs45}He's napping, ser. Wake him for a stag.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:51.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我……\N{\fs45}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.85,0:16:54.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我没有一银鹿\N{\fs45}I don't have a stag.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:56.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,什么样的骑士连一银鹿都没有啊？\N{\fs45}What kind of knight don't got a stag?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:58.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 是雇佣骑士 对吧？ - 什么？\N{\fs45}-It's a hedge knight, ain't it? -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:01.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,算是个骑士 不过惨了点\N{\fs45}It's like a knight, but sadder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:02.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不 我才不惨……\N{\fs45}No, I'm-- I'm not sad--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:04.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他得睡草堆 因为没有领主大人要他\N{\fs45}He's gotta sleep in the hedges 'cause no lord'll have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:07.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,哦 那确实惨\N{\fs45}Aw. That is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.99,0:17:10.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,而且曼佛德爵士还睡了他老婆\N{\fs45}And Ser Manfred's fucked its wife, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:13.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 才没 我没有老婆 - 喔！\N{\fs45}-No, I don't have a wife. -Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:15.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,因为我们都习惯了丈夫们找上门来\N{\fs45}'Cause we're used to husbands coming 'round.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:16.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那家伙喜欢睡人妻\N{\fs45}Likes fucking wives, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:18.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,快赶上喜欢睡我们了\N{\fs45}Near as much as he likes fucking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:21.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他跟我说 他的使命是染红整个世界\N{\fs45}Told me he's on a mission to turn the whole world red.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.50,0:17:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 我们本来就是红的 - 可不嘛\N{\fs45}-Well, we're already red. -So we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:31.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那么 你们觉得曼佛德爵士什么时候会醒呢？\N{\fs45}Well, when do you expect Ser Manfred to wake, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:34.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你傍晚再过来看看吧\N{\fs45}It might wanna try back at evenfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:36.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,傍晚\N{\fs45}Evenfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:40.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 好\N{\fs45}-Goodbye. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.98,0:17:43.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fs45}Arse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:50.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,她干嘛这么说 嗯？\N{\fs45}Why'd she say that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:53.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们才不惨\N{\fs45}We're not sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,肯定没惨到值得大说特说的地步\N{\fs45}Certainly not rising-to-the-level-of-a-comment sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,更何况 阿兰爵士总说……\N{\fs45}Besides, Ser Arlan always said that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,雇佣骑士是最纯粹的骑士\N{\fs45}a hedge knight was the truest kind of knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:11.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,等我们赢了第一场比武 就能得到输家的盔甲\N{\fs45}When we win our first tilt, we'll have the loser's armor
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.76,0:18:13.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,马匹 或者他的赎金\N{\fs45}and horse, or his gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:15.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那时候咱就不惨了\N{\fs45}Won't be sad then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:25.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我知道 应该说“如果我们赢了”\N{\fs45}I know. Said if we did win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:30.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,听着 短暂地享受美好的念头又不是对国王犯下什么罪\N{\fs45}Look, it's not a crime against the king to enjoy a nice thought for a trice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:34.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,别跟我胡闹 雷蒙\N{\fs45}Do not muck about with me, Raymun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.91,0:18:38.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你就是个没用的废物\N{\fs45}You're a good-for-nothing useless rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你这蓝眼贱人看什么呢\N{\fs45}What are you gawping at, you blue-eyed cunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:55.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你佩的是柄长剑？\N{\fs45}That's a longsword you wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:18:59.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是的 我完全有权佩戴它\N{\fs45}Yes, it is mine by right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这话可真新鲜\N{\fs45}That's an odd thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.19,0:19:08.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我是史蒂芬·佛索威爵士 过来跟我比划比划\N{\fs45}I'm Ser Steffon Fossoway. Come try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:11.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你也看到了 我这个堂弟还没熟呢\N{\fs45}As you see, me cousin here is not ripe yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:13.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,上吧 爵士\N{\fs45}Do it, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:16.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我或许是没熟 但我堂哥早就烂到了芯儿里了\N{\fs45}I may not be ripe, but my cousin's rotten to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:18.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 把他的烂籽砸出来瞧瞧 - 闭嘴！\N{\fs45}-Knock the seeds out of him. -Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:24.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,承蒙邀请 但我还有事在身\N{\fs45}I thank you, but I have matters to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:26.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,哦 雇佣骑士的营生是吧 还能有什么事\N{\fs45}What, matters of the hedge, I have no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.38,0:19:31.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你可真他妈高啊\N{\fs45}Fucking size of ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.38,0:19:34.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,蠢蛋 格兰斯爵士！\N{\fs45}Stupid bastard. Ser Grance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.47,0:19:42.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,也许我们应该找个更安静点儿的住处\N{\fs45}Perhaps we should seek quieter accommodations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:34.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,呃 操\N{\fs45}Oh. Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.67,0:20:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他还在打盹\N{\fs45}He's napping still.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 还睡？ - 嗯\N{\fs45}-Still? -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.59,0:20:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,都是因为他那患痛风的脚趾头\N{\fs45}On account of his gouty toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.51,0:21:02.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,人生里一点荒诞的小苦难 没错\N{\fs45}One of life's absurd little miseries, to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:06.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,夜夜都折腾得够呛 可怜见的\N{\fs45}Makes for restless nights. The poor dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:08.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是 绝对的 只是……\N{\fs45}Right, absolutely. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:10.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这样啊 可我得尽快和他谈谈\N{\fs45}Well, it is of some urgency that I speak with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:13.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这样我明天才能上场\N{\fs45}so I may enter the lists on the morrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:18.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 上什么场？ - 就是比武大会\N{\fs45}-What's this? -It means the joust.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:19.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那个啊 可危险了\N{\fs45}Awful dangerous, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.74,0:21:20.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是 不过……\N{\fs45}Yes, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:24.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我还够不上选择多到挑花眼的那种人 不是吗？\N{\fs45}I'm not troubled with a wealth of options, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:27.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,而且如果我想在城堡里服侍——\N{\fs45}And if I mean to take service in a castle--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:30.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,就得豁出这副身子 讨陌生人开心\N{\fs45}It must put its body at hazard for the pleasure of strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那不是咱的营生吗？\N{\fs45}Ain't that our job?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.67,0:21:35.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,啊！闭嘴！你该好好装死\N{\fs45}Ah! Shut up! You're meant to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:39.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,找个安稳点的行当吧 小子 你会幸福得多\N{\fs45}Find a safer trade, lad. You'll be happier for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.22,0:21:41.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,婊子劝婊子\N{\fs45}One whore to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.51,0:21:47.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你们非得笑话我吗？\N{\fs45}Must you mock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.85,0:21:50.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我只不过是想寻求一点帮助\N{\fs45}I was only asking for a bit of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:53.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我明早再来找曼佛德爵士试试\N{\fs45}I'll try Ser Manfred back in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.44,0:21:56.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 小子\N{\fs45}Sorry, lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.11,0:21:59.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,哎 我们也不是存心取笑你\N{\fs45}Aye. We don't mean to mock you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:02.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,每次比武大会 我们见多了嫩的像青草的男孩\N{\fs45}We see plenty of green boys every tourney.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:05.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,个个都是 荣耀心中求 从未手上有\N{\fs45}All with glory in their minds, but never in their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,好吧 或许我会不一样\N{\fs45}Well, perhaps I will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.75,0:22:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,对你自己的身子好点吧 骑士 你也就剩这一副肉体了\N{\fs45}Be good to your body, knight. Last one you're like to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:27.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们勇敢的英雄毅然向前 将熟知的一切抛诸身后\N{\fs45}Our brave hero forges on, leaving all he knows behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:33.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,亦父亦友 或已然察觉这个世界恶意不休\N{\fs45}A father and a friend, may seem the world unkind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.69,0:22:38.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,命运早将他孤独的路途 铺设于机遇长廊之中\N{\fs45}Fate has set his lonely path through corridors of chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.69,0:22:44.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,白身的男孩豪赌上一切 无视两旁斜觑眼瞳\N{\fs45}A boy from nothing risks it all, ignoring looks askance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.57,0:22:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,或许他单单只是愚蠢 紧握他的镜盾不放\N{\fs45}Perhaps he's only stupid holding fast his mirror shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,至高荣誉是他的雄心 必须将那真相隐藏\N{\fs45}Great honor his ambition, must keep a truth concealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.33,0:22:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,若他卑微的原形暴露 污火焚身 性命随之而去\N{\fs45}For if his humble shape is bared, a foul and fiery demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那巨龙终将识破诡计 伪装之下 不过凡人一具\N{\fs45}Should the dragon discover none but a man in great disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:41.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,半人！ 半人！\N{\fs45}Halfman! Halfman!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.46,0:23:45.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你觉得我看起来像个半人吗？\N{\fs45}Do I look like a half man to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.30,0:23:48.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,对啊 半人 半巨人\N{\fs45}Aye. Half man, half giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.09,0:23:49.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,听我说 我很抱歉\N{\fs45}Look, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.64,0:23:51.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我不该怂恿你去挑战我堂哥\N{\fs45}I should not have urged you to try my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.76,0:23:55.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他会打断你的手 或打碎你一个膝盖 只要他能\N{\fs45}He'd have broken your hand or a knee, if he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.10,0:23:56.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他喜欢在训练场里先把人打一顿\N{\fs45}He likes to batter men in the yard,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.02,0:23:59.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你懂的 以防在比武场上再碰到\N{\fs45}you know, in case he meets them in the lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.98,0:24:02.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他没打伤你啊\N{\fs45}He did not break you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:04.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我是他的血亲\N{\fs45}I'm his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.90,0:24:06.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不过呢 他长在苹果树上的主枝上\N{\fs45}Though he is the senior branch of the apple tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.07,0:24:08.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他没完没了地提醒我这一点\N{\fs45}which he never ceases to remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.49,0:24:12.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你和你堂哥都会参加比武吗？\N{\fs45}Will you and your cousin ride in the tourney?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.91,0:24:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他会 我能的话倒是想参加 但我只是个侍从\N{\fs45}He will. I would that I could, but I'm only a squire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.13,0:24:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,以一个侍从来说 你打得很好啊\N{\fs45}Fight well for a squire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.21,0:24:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你看起来像个挑战者 你打算敲谁的盾？\N{\fs45}You have the look of a challenger. Whose shield do you mean to strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.72,0:24:32.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,都没差别\N{\fs45}Makes no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.55,0:24:34.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这是句你应该说的话\N{\fs45}That's what you're supposed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.19,0:24:41.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,实际上是天差地别\N{\fs45}Though it makes all the difference in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.48,0:24:45.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你饿了吗？\N{\fs45}You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.86,0:24:47.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,一直都饿\N{\fs45}Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.09,0:25:15.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,莱昂诺·拜拉席恩 人称“狂笑风暴”\N{\fs45}Lyonel Baratheon. The Laughing Storm, they call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.93,0:25:18.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我以为他块头会更大些\N{\fs45}I thought he'd be bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.48,0:25:20.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,四千年以前……\N{\fs45}Four thousand years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.98,0:25:24.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 四千年…… - 你上哪儿去？\N{\fs45}-Four thousand years... -Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.19,0:25:27.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- ……以前 - 这帮贱货 我都听不见我自己了\N{\fs45}-...ago - cunts. I can't hear myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.07,0:25:32.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我有一洞见 如诸位愿静听\N{\fs45}I've had a profound thought, if anyone would care to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.28,0:25:38.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,四千年以前\N{\fs45}Four thousand years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.70,0:25:44.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们的先祖就聚集在外面那片大地上\N{\fs45}our ancestors gathered in that big field outside
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.42,0:25:48.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,互相用棍子捅出血 再享受些同性欢愉\N{\fs45}to blood each other with sticks and have a little bit of gay fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.92,0:25:52.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他们说 那是这个王国的首场比武大会\N{\fs45}And they say it was this country's first-ever joust.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.55,0:25:54.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,要我说……\N{\fs45}Well, I say...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.93,0:26:01.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我他妈要说啥来着？\N{\fs45}The fuck was I gonna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.02,0:26:03.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,“首场比武大会……”\N{\fs45}"First-ever joust..."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.56,0:26:06.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fs45}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.65,0:26:12.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,凡人无法创设此等欢愉\N{\fs45}Men could not have devised such a joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.87,0:26:16.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那么 是谁呢？\N{\fs45}So, who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.62,0:26:21.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fs45}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.71,0:26:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是谁呢？\N{\fs45}Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.38,0:26:37.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,去他妈的 不管是人 畜生还是神 谁捅我捅得最猛 赏一百金币\N{\fs45}Fuck it. A hundred gold to the man, beast, or god who sticks me best.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.47,0:26:42.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,现在 吃了你们的鸟 我们好舞起来！\N{\fs45}Now, eat your birds so we can dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.75,0:27:47.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你有没有被人一拳揍脸上过？\N{\fs45}You ever been punched in the face before?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.17,0:27:51.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,您说什么 莱昂诺爵士？\N{\fs45}I beg your pardon, Ser Lyonel?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.92,0:27:55.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,大块头 往往比小块头挨的拳头要多 这你知道吧？\N{\fs45}Big men get punched more than little men. Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.68,0:27:59.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不知道 但我信\N{\fs45}No, but I believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.68,0:28:05.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这就是你含胸驼背的缘故？ 免得挨拳头？\N{\fs45}That why you slouch? So you don't get punched?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.89,0:28:08.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我没含胸驼背\N{\fs45}I don't slouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.27,0:28:12.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,哦 那你整晚都缩成一团 像个新婚夜的少女\N{\fs45}Oh, you've been cowering all evening like a maiden on her wedding night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.78,0:28:18.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 爵士 说老实话\N{\fs45}I meant no disrespect, ser, honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.20,0:28:21.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,在我长大那地儿 你得低调行事 就这么回事\N{\fs45}Where I grew up, you learn to go unnoticed, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.66,0:28:24.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,天上七神赐你挺拔之姿\N{\fs45}The seven above gave you tallness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.45,0:28:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你便应当挺立于世\N{\fs45}So, be tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.12,0:28:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,否则我就判你为异教徒 然后烧死你\N{\fs45}Or I will name you a heretic and burn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.96,0:28:35.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,淹死你 把你抛下高——\N{\fs45}Drown you. Drop you off a tall pl--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.84,0:28:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我不知道 他们都怎么处置异教徒？\N{\fs45}I don't know. What do they do to heretics?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.76,0:28:40.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,烧死他们 大人\N{\fs45}Burn them, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.30,0:28:41.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fs45}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.05,0:28:43.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你要为我献上什么？\N{\fs45}What have you brought me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.35,0:28:53.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,爵士 我—— 请您见谅 我没想到\N{\fs45}Ser, I-- beggin' your pardons. I didn't realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.94,0:28:56.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你多多少少是想博我欢心\N{\fs45}You wish to curry my favor some.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.45,0:29:00.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但你却空手而来\N{\fs45}Yet you come with an empty hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.66,0:29:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,卡伏伦伯爵\N{\fs45}Lord Cafferen,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.12,0:29:07.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,穿红衣服那个 正得意忘形的贱货\N{\fs45}the smug cunt in red...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.46,0:29:11.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他连地租都快付不起了\N{\fs45}he is scarce to pay his rents.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.62,0:29:16.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他的子民每个冬天都忍饥挨饿 但他还是 献上这么个\N{\fs45}His people starve each winter, yet even he shinied up this...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.51,0:29:19.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,自家地窖翻出来 擦得闪亮亮的小玩意儿\N{\fs45}bauble from his family's cellars,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.42,0:29:22.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,因为他懂 这世上所有人 各凭本事\N{\fs45}for he understands that all men, in their way,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.43,0:29:25.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,要么寻求你施以援手 要么觊觎你项上人头\N{\fs45}wish only for your help, or your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.89,0:29:30.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,所以你是来取我项上人头的咯\N{\fs45}You've come for my head, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:33.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,什——什么？\N{\fs45}Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.73,0:29:36.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不是！ 不是\N{\fs45}No! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.57,0:29:40.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那你他妈到底为什么在我的帐篷里？\N{\fs45}Then, why the fuck are you in my tent?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.16,0:29:46.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,晚——晚——晚饭\N{\fs45}Su-Su-Supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.67,0:30:00.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fs45}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.88,0:30:04.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,倒是挺合理\N{\fs45}Actually makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.05,0:30:06.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 吃晚饭 - 年轻人 你叫什么名字？\N{\fs45}-Supper. -What is your name, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.77,0:30:10.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,邓克——邓克爵士\N{\fs45}Dunk-- Ser Dunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.10,0:30:11.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这名字也太荒谬了\N{\fs45}That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.65,0:30:17.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你喜欢跳舞吗？\N{\fs45}Do you like dancing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.02,0:30:19.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,谁不喜欢呢？\N{\fs45}Doesn't everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.40,0:30:24.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿！嘿！嘿！\N{\fs45}Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.90,0:31:49.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,浪涛汹涌 空气里都能尝出咸味儿\N{\fs45}The swells heaved. You could lick salt from the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.12,0:31:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,而我正是为了探寻人们葬身大海之时会做什么而来\N{\fs45}But I'd come to find what men do when they die at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.04,0:31:59.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,所以 我冲进了风暴\N{\fs45}So, drove I on into the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.71,0:32:06.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 你不怕吗？ - 嗯\N{\fs45}-Weren't you afraid? -Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.93,0:32:11.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,每个人内心深处 都有许多不同的自我\N{\fs45}Within every man, there are many men.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.77,0:32:15.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs45}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.27,0:32:18.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但这是我必须做的 风暴地人一向如此\N{\fs45}But that I had to do, Stormlanders had always done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.02,0:32:22.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,既然他们都能做到 那我也能\N{\fs45}And if they had done it, I could do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.27,0:32:24.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,哼\N{\fs45}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.19,0:32:27.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你懂的 最好别自找苦恼\N{\fs45}You know, it's best not to agonize.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.41,0:32:33.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我明白 我也常常感到苦恼\N{\fs45}Yeah, I agonize a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.41,0:32:35.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs45}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.79,0:32:38.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,有时苦恼过头了\N{\fs45}Sometimes, I think I agonize too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.87,0:32:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这苦恼本身又带来了另一种折磨\N{\fs45}and I just end up agonizing over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.38,0:32:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs45}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.80,0:32:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我敏捷又强壮 毫无疑问\N{\fs45}I'm quick and strong, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.97,0:32:49.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 毫无疑问 - 但您也如此\N{\fs45}-Sure. -But so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.59,0:32:50.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs45}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.68,0:32:53.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,而且 您还曾跟随王国中最精锐的教头\N{\fs45}Plus, you've trained sword and lance
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.18,0:32:55.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,学习过剑术和枪法\N{\fs45}with the finest masters-at-arms in the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.60,0:32:56.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我的意思是……\N{\fs45}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.73,0:33:00.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我有任何胜算吗？说真的？\N{\fs45}what chance do I have? Truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.81,0:33:03.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,噢 你没有胜算\N{\fs45}Oh, you have no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.86,0:33:14.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但是和可敬的对手一较高下 是一种莫大的荣幸\N{\fs45}But it's a great honor to test oneself against a worthy foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.45,0:33:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 恕我直言 爵士 - 嗯\N{\fs45}-No disrespect, ser. -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.37,0:33:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这话您说起来很轻松\N{\fs45}That's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.92,0:33:24.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,您有名气 有家世\N{\fs45}You have a name, an inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.42,0:33:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,而我只要输一场 连自己的马都赎不回\N{\fs45}One loss, and I won't be able to ransom back my own horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.26,0:33:37.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,没有马的骑士根本算不上骑士\N{\fs45}A knight without a horse is no knight at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.39,0:33:40.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 嗯\N{\fs45}-Aye. -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.98,0:33:45.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,所以我该怎么做？\N{\fs45}So, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.69,0:33:51.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fs45}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.99,0:33:55.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我真的喝大了\N{\fs45}I'm really quite drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.13,0:34:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs45}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.21,0:34:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fs45}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.26,0:34:12.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fs45}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.03,0:34:35.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,铜分树村的阿兰爵士\N{\fs45}Ser Arlan of Pennytree.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.74,0:34:38.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他曾助您父亲大人\N{\fs45}He served your Lord Father
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.79,0:34:40.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,在赤红山脉击杀秃鹰王\N{\fs45}to hunt the Vulture King in the Red Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.62,0:34:42.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我当时还小 但是——\N{\fs45}I was only a boy, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.83,0:34:44.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你不是说自己是多恩人吗？\N{\fs45}I thought you said you were a Dornishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.42,0:34:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不 他说他像多恩人一样被吊了起来\N{\fs45}No, he said he's hung like a Dornishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.75,0:34:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不 我说我吊死过多恩人\N{\fs45}No, I said I've hung Dornishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.92,0:34:54.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,或许我们可以明早再谈\N{\fs45}Perhaps we would speak on the morn.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.76,0:34:56.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我不认识你的铜板骑士\N{\fs45}I know your penny knight not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.51,0:34:58.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,也不认识你 哥们 你走吧\N{\fs45}Nor you, brother. Be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.14,0:35:06.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但阿兰爵士曾在为您父亲效力时受过伤\N{\fs45}But Ser Arlan took a wound in your father's service.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.27,0:35:07.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你怎么能忘了他？\N{\fs45}How could you have forgotten him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.61,0:35:13.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,家父率八百名战士进山\N{\fs45}My lord father took 800 swords into those mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.90,0:35:17.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,连谁送了命我们都不记得 更何况是受伤的？\N{\fs45}We've forgotten men who reaped much more than a wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.95,0:35:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,拜托了 爵士 我没有资格参加比武\N{\fs45}Please, ser, I will not be allowed to challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.91,0:35:23.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,除非找到骑士或领主为我担保\N{\fs45}unless a knight or a lord will vouch for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.62,0:35:24.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这关我什么事？\N{\fs45}And what is that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.02,0:35:52.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是你！\N{\fs45}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.65,0:35:54.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,什么……\N{\fs45}What...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.99,0:35:58.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fs45}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.32,0:36:01.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,烤鱼啊 来点儿吗？\N{\fs45}Cooking a fish. Do you want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.20,0:36:05.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不！我是说 你怎么过来的？偷了匹马吗？\N{\fs45}No! I mean, how did you get here? Did you steal a horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.00,0:36:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我搭运羊车来的\N{\fs45}I rode in the back of a lamb cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.00,0:36:10.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,运羊车\N{\fs45}Lamb cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.71,0:36:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 那你最好能再找另一辆车 - 你赶不走我\N{\fs45}-Well, you best find another one. -You can't make me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.21,0:36:16.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我受够那家旅馆了\N{\fs45}I'd had enough of that inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.09,0:36:19.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,听着 小子 我不会再容忍你的无礼了\N{\fs45}Now, listen, I'll have no more insolence from you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.55,0:36:22.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我可以把你扔到马背上 一路押回家\N{\fs45}I should throw you over my horse and take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.26,0:36:24.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那你得一路骑到君临\N{\fs45}You'd need to ride all the way to King's Landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.81,0:36:27.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 你会错过比武的 - 君临？\N{\fs45}-You'd miss the tourney. -King's Landing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.27,0:36:30.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 你从跳蚤窝来的？ - 不是\N{\fs45}-You're from Flea Bottom? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.94,0:36:32.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs45}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.62,0:36:42.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这些挂这儿干什么？\N{\fs45}What are those doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.12,0:36:43.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我洗过了\N{\fs45}I washed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.62,0:36:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我生了火 抓了鱼 还给马梳了毛\N{\fs45}I made the fire, caught the fish, and groomed the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.66,0:36:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我本来还想给你搭帐篷 但是我没找到帐篷\N{\fs45}I would have raised your pavilion, but I couldn't find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.04,0:36:53.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 这就是我的帐篷 - 这是棵树\N{\fs45}-There's my pavilion. -That's a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.42,0:36:56.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是 真正的骑士用它当帐篷就够了\N{\fs45}Yes, and it's all the pavilion a true knight needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.01,0:36:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,与其睡在烟雾弥漫的帐篷里 我宁愿睡在星空下\N{\fs45}I'd sooner sleep under the stars than in some smoky tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.55,0:37:02.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,要是下雨了怎么办？\N{\fs45}What if it rains?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:05.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,树会为我挡雨\N{\fs45}The tree will shelter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.31,0:37:06.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,树会漏雨\N{\fs45}Trees leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.02,0:37:10.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fs45}So they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.69,0:37:11.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fs45}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.11,0:37:15.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 邓克 - 邓克爵士\N{\fs45}-Dunk. -Ser Dunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.61,0:37:18.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,没有骑士叫这种名字 这是邓肯的简称吗？\N{\fs45}That's no name for a knight. Is it short for Duncan?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.78,0:37:21.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,对 是的\N{\fs45}Yeah. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.99,0:37:23.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,邓克爵士 来自……\N{\fs45}Ser Duncan of...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.71,0:37:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,“高个”邓肯爵士\N{\fs45}Ser Duncan the Tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.12,0:37:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,没听说过\N{\fs45}Never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.79,0:37:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那你认得七大王国里的每位骑士吗？\N{\fs45}Do you know every knight in the Seven Kingdoms, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.75,0:37:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,排得上号的我都认得\N{\fs45}The good ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.01,0:37:42.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 小贼 你叫什么？ - 伊戈\N{\fs45}-You got a name, thief? -Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.47,0:37:43.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,伊戈\N{\fs45}Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.18,0:37:48.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,好吧 伊戈 按理说我本该狠揍你一顿\N{\fs45}Well, Egg, by rights, I should beat you bloody,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.02,0:37:50.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,然后赶你走\N{\fs45}send you on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.10,0:37:53.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但你看上去吃得不多\N{\fs45}But you look as though you don't eat much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.27,0:37:57.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,如果你发誓乖乖听话……\N{\fs45}And if you'll swear to do as you're told...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.65,0:38:01.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我就让你在比武大会当我的侍从\N{\fs45}I'll let you serve me for the tourney.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.03,0:38:05.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,再之后……\N{\fs45}After that, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.66,0:38:08.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,到时候再说吧\N{\fs45}we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.62,0:38:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我没什么钱 但如果你能证明自己的价值……\N{\fs45}I don't have much, but if you prove worth your keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.92,0:38:19.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我保证你能穿暖身子填饱肚子\N{\fs45}you'll have clothes on your back and food in your belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.46,0:38:22.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,穿的也许是粗布 吃的可能是\N{\fs45}The clothes might be rough-spun and the food,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.88,0:38:24.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,咸牛肉和咸鱼\N{\fs45}salt beef and salt fish,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.97,0:38:26.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但总不会饿着\N{\fs45}but you won't go hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.14,0:38:29.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我保证不会打你\N{\fs45}I promise not to beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.06,0:38:32.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,除非你自找的\N{\fs45}Except when you deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.64,0:38:34.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,遵命 大人\N{\fs45}Yes, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.36,0:38:37.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是“爵士”\N{\fs45}"Ser."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.23,0:38:40.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我只是个雇佣骑士\N{\fs45}I'm only a hedge knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.41,0:38:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,流星会给看见它的人带来好运\N{\fs45}A falling star brings luck to those who see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.34,0:39:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,睡吧 小子\N{\fs45}Go to sleep, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.30,0:39:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,其他骑士现在都睡在帐篷里呢\N{\fs45}All the other knights are in their pavilions by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.47,0:39:05.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他们盯着丝绸而不是天空\N{\fs45}staring up at silk instead of sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.05,0:39:09.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你想挨耳刮子吗？\N{\fs45}Do you want a clout in the ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.73,0:39:22.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,所以 这好运独属于我们咯？\N{\fs45}So, the luck is ours alone?
Comment: 0,0:36:58.50,0:37:02.50,Character_B,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(1351.111,660)}莱昂诺·拜拉席恩\N{\b0\fs33.75}“狂笑风暴”\N风息堡公爵 拜拉席恩家族族长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:05:06.54,Titles,,0,0,0,,{\c&eceaec&\fad(3000,2000)\pos(960,740)\b1}七王国的骑士\N\N{\fs48}第一季 第一集
